---

---
<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-24 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400">
        About Me
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        The Person Behind the Code.
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-400">
        I enjoy turning ideas into useful software and understanding
        how things work behind the scenes.
    </p>

    <!--Two column layout-->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

        <!--Column 1-->
        <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300">
            <p>
                I'm studying Applied Computer Science at the University of Winnipeg, with a minor in Mathematics. What I enjoy most about programming is taking an idea, working through the challenges, and building something people can actually use.
            </p>
            <p>
                Projects like TaskHub have helped me develop my frontend skills, while PChat is allowing me to explore backend development, databases, and real-time communication. I'm always looking to improve how I build software, from the way it works to the experience it creates for users.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!--Column 2-->
        <div class="grid gap-4">

            <!--Card 1-->
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-400">
                    Education
                </p>

                <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                    University of Winnipeg
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
                    Bachelor of Science in Applied Computer Science,
                    with a minor in Mathematics.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!--Card 2-->
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-400">
                    What I Build
                </p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                    Applications & Software
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
                    I build responsive web applications and practical tools,
                    focusing on useful features, clean interfaces,
                    and code that's easy to maintain.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!--Card 3-->
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-400">
                    Current Focus
                </p>

                <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                    Backend & Cloud Development
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
                    I'm strengthening my skills in APIs, PostgreSQL, Docker, testing, and cloud deployment while building more complete full-stack applications.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>